  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The move is created by Bai Ning Bing. The killer move does not let out any aura when activated, because the aura is stored as tiny ice pearls on the ice thread. The disadvantage of this move is that it sacrifices some of its power, and once there are too many ice pearls, they combine into one and turn into a noose that strangles Bai Ning Bing, causing serious injuries or even death.",
