      "mentions": [
        "char_bai_ning_bing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bai Ning Bing wants to refine Gu herself. If she could refine an ice pearl Immortal Gu, it would supplement this killer move greatly. She has already collected most of the immortal materials. In treasure yellow heaven she sells immortal materials and gives a list of ice and snow path immortal materials she needs, then completes a transaction and leaves.",
